  "details": "There are two types of the new keybaord right now, one is number, one is text with numbers hide behind a button. Some might prefer full keyboard always since everything will be on the same spot no matter what, which is very important for quick input. And some people did used to standalone numpad on PC.\n\nBy allowing dockable numpad it mean players can choose between these states:\n\n1. Full keyboard with docked numpad.(even it's number type input field)\n\n2. Full keyboard with undocked numpad.(even it's number type input field)\n\n3. Pure numpad for the number type input field.",
